let<br>Other characters will be added in future updates.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1734070/extras/6fa83bb91f2d33903e00a79cdae06a2a.poster.avif?t=1741302317\" width=574 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1734070/extras/6fa83bb91f2d33903e00a79cdae06a2a.webm?t=1741302317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1734070/extras/6fa83bb91f2d33903e00a79cdae06a2a.mp4?t=1741302317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strengthen your character by collecting items!</h2>Build your ideal style with the high-tempo reinforcement system and abundant items!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1734070/extras/31b595c2757059f91562eb6beb8a2f27.poster.avif?t=1741302317\" width=574 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1734070/extras/31b595c2757059f91562eb6beb8a2f27.webm?t=1741302317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1734070/extras/31b595c2757059f91562eb6beb8a2f27.mp4?t=1741302317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1734070/extras/133369bee87482df4f1218a90ac656d9.apng?t=1741302317\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1734070/extras/133369bee87482df4f1218a90ac656d9.poster.avif?t=1741302317\" class=\"bb_img\" width=566 height=128 /></picture></span>", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam